      "source_path": "candidate-packs/clm_314f2d309fea25e6/02-heating-service-observation.txt",
      "quote": "On 2025-02-21 at07:30, a calibrated digital instrument (fictional calibration check2024-12-15, uncertainty±0.2C) measured the living room at15.8C after overnight normal operation. Main living rooms stayed15.5–16.3C in the seven-day logger record. Resets restore heat briefly; the pump cuts out repeatedly. The fixed circulation pump has an internal bearing/control failure; it is part of landlord-maintained equipment, outside ordinary small tenant maintenance. Normal ventilation and unobstructed radiators were observed; no tenant alteration or misuse explains the failure.",
